{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121682","id":4116335887,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc71Wk0P","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121682","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121682.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121682.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121682","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121682/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121682/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121682/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/10241033dc06e01dc1cda0ae767279052a14fab1","number":121682,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"3D: Add origin anchor when placing scenes","user":{"login":"benioriginal","id":111044589,"node_id":"U_kgDOBp5n7Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111044589?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal","html_url":"https://github.com/benioriginal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benioriginal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\nThis implements the improvement proposed in:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13299\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Preserve the existing AABB-based placement behavior by default.\r\n- Allow holding Ctrl on Windows/Linux, or Cmd on macOS, to place a dragged PackedScene using its origin.\r\n- Allow the origin-placement modifier to be combined with the existing Shift and Alt hierarchy modifiers.\r\n- Document the new modifier in the 3D viewport drop tooltip.\r\n- Keep meshes, materials, textures, and audio on their existing drop behavior.\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\nWhen dragging a scene into the 3D viewport:\r\n\r\n- No modifier: place using the existing AABB-based anchor.\r\n- Hold Ctrl/Cmd: place the scene origin at the surface hit position.\r\n- Hold Shift: add the scene as a child of the selected node.\r\n- Hold Alt: add the scene as a child of the scene root.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94018e72-9bc1-4f03-8a33-a9d02aa69399\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13299*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/m